    "commit": "e52dd8f0f",
    "summary": "Watcher batches pass through filterBatch: a .gitignore in the batch, or a content change to the clone's exclude / global ignore file (changedIgnoreFile), triggers refreshFileFilter before the batch is judged; files the refresh moved are reported as delete (left) / create (entered) so they leave/enter the index without re-adding the repo (ac5). refreshedFileFilter now refreshes the held instance in place so the watcher and indexer never judge by different filters. src/indexer suites 325/327 (the 2 failures are the session-source inventory guard on other work's files)."
